          "description": "3 to 8 branch labels from the source (2-4 words each). Give exactly ONE branch `children`: 2 or 3 objects, each {label (2-4 words), text (one short sentence, about 12 words, 80 characters at most)}. The video zooms to that branch and shows its children as branching stars, then stays there. Never invent branches or children; leave `children` out rather than make them up.",
